<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">Nominal Capacitance (Conductor to Conductor): less than or equal to 36.5 pF/ft</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">High Impedance Loudspeaker Cable (70V / 100V)</OLI><BRK/>
