<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">Nominal Capacitance (Conductor to Conductor): less than or equal to 34 pF/ft</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">Antenna Cables - RG58 - Wireless Microphone and Assisted Listening</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">50 ohm RG-58 19 AWG solid center conductor</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">Nominal Capacitance (Conductor to Shield): less than or equal to 27 pF/ft</OLI><BRK/>
