<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">50 ohm RG-8/U 10 AWG solid center conductor</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">Nominal Capacitance (Conductor to Shield): less than or equal to 25 pF/ft</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">Nominal Attenuation at 900MHz: less than or equal to 4 dB/100 ft</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">Video Tie Line Cable:</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
