<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">Nominal Capacitance (Conductor to Shield): less than or equal to 16.5 pF/ft</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">Nominal Attenuation at 3000MHz: less than or equal to 18 dB/100 ft</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
