<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="3">Nominal Attenuation at 1000MHz: less than or equal to 13.5 dB/100 ft</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">Digital Video SUTP Tie Line Cable</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
